WEBVTT

00:30:59.704 --> 00:31:05.163
and recognizing them for everything
that they gave X,

00:31:05.163 --> 00:31:07.579
and just like how X has
benefited from them.

00:31:07.579 --> 00:31:13.538
And I do think that it would be too much
to say people are happy when their

00:31:13.538 --> 00:31:17.121
projects are killed or it's
a positive experience.

00:31:17.163 --> 00:31:21.954
Certainly not like everyone is human,
but at least it normalizes it.

00:31:22.288 --> 00:31:25.788
Beyond throwing a party to celebrate
the value of a failed project,

00:31:26.121 --> 00:31:28.038
Cathy's boss went further.

00:31:28.204 --> 00:31:32.163
He ended up giving us a bonus. And what?